        Don''t want to break the
        whole loop, but just want to skip this specific turn? ''continue'' skips
        the rest of the current cycle and immediately jumps to the next one!

        Example:
        for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) { if (roomIsLocked) { continue; /* Skip to next
        room! */ } }""'
